[{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"喂","startTime":"600","endTime":"1600"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"同学你好。","startTime":"3000","endTime":"4600"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"你现在是。放学了是吗。","startTime":"6000","endTime":"7600"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"那这边的话，我昨天跟你说的那个我是海豚ai学的陈老师就是你今天有没有时间来看一看我们的课？","startTime":"10000","endTime":"17400"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"什么","startTime":"22600","endTime":"23200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"你跟你家长说说。然后家长处是吗？","startTime":"28400","endTime":"31400"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"他说，他是说，让你不要学学我们海豚吗？还是什么。","startTime":"39000","endTime":"42600"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"你还有其他的好多课是吧。","startTime":"49000","endTime":"51000"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"你还有其他的。什么课呀。","startTime":"52600","endTime":"54200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"就是说。","startTime":"63000","endTime":"64000"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"还有个生物，那就是我们就是周末的一个补习班是吗？","startTime":"64800","endTime":"68600"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"那我们是。","startTime":"70800","endTime":"72600"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"就是周一到周五也有吗？","startTime":"73600","endTime":"75600"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"都周一到。周五也是有的。","startTime":"78400","endTime":"80600"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"那像，但是像我们海豚的话，基本上十五分钟就能学一个知识点，要不你今天来看看试试。","startTime":"82200","endTime":"87950"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"先试试对不对？花十五分钟左右的时间，比如说自己吃个饭时间甚实都比这个长了，对不对？那我们先来试试一个知识点，看对。你有没有用？对不对？我们先慢慢自己去学，然后看这个时间能不能能不能适应过来，对不对？","startTime":"88150","endTime":"101400"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"因为老师觉得你是自己来买的话，其实我觉得你应该对自己的学习还是有想提升的一个地方的，对不对？","startTime":"105000","endTime":"112200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"对吧，而且我们这边十五分钟我也不会给你去布置额外的作业，我们每天就过来先看一个知识点，我们慢慢看好不好？","startTime":"115200","endTime":"121800"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"行","startTime":"128200","endTime":"129600"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"你说。你回去再看吗。","startTime":"142600","endTime":"144000"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"那你先好好上学。是吧。","startTime":"152800","endTime":"155600"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"就是说他们给你安排的那个课是吧。","startTime":"159400","endTime":"162200"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"可是那如果说你当时上那个课，如果说有收获的话，为什么你还想买我们海豚，这是为什么？","startTime":"164000","endTime":"170600"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"就是好奇，可是我看你后奇，你也没有来上过。","startTime":"175600","endTime":"178800"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"就把我们入门测给做了这个入门测的话，只是我们的一个看你基础的一个地方，但是我们第一节课都还没上呢，就，十五分钟。要不先来试试。","startTime":"179200","endTime":"189000"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"行吧，行吧，那这样我这个课的话，提前先给你解锁，我们这边有时间就直接来看可以吗？因为就十五分钟左右，可以吧。","startTime":"197000","endTime":"205000"},{"identityType":"teacher","channelId":0,"text":"好的。好的。拜拜。","startTime":"206200","endTime":"207800"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"嗯","startTime":"9200","endTime":"9600"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"我。是的。","startTime":"21200","endTime":"22800"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"by。","startTime":"24800","endTime":"27400"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"你先看了个路的这个中，一个孩子个。","startTime":"32200","endTime":"37600"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"上这个课。我还有他的好多。","startTime":"45600","endTime":"48600"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"你","startTime":"103800","endTime":"104200"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"呃。他上学。","startTime":"122400","endTime":"123400"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"we，to。bus。","startTime":"138800","endTime":"140000"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"我以经听我家长，家长说不让我先整这个，让我先上别的，好好上。","startTime":"146600","endTime":"153000"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"不认。我想想。","startTime":"156200","endTime":"158600"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"不是","startTime":"163000","endTime":"163400"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"我当时就是好奇了。","startTime":"173000","endTime":"175600"},{"identityType":"student","channelId":1,"text":"先子，明天。","startTime":"193400","endTime":"194800"}]